a "pile" is a viewable, droppable list of cards
	-- A pile of cards, e.g. in a game like solitaire.
	-- A card can only be in one pile at a time.
	its "layout" is one of stacked or vertical
		-- stacked = on top of each other
		-- vertical = spread down in a column
	a pile's "color" is
		"none" if it is empty
		the color of its last card otherwise
	a pile's "value" is
		0 if it is empty
		otherwise the value of its last card
	its "shorthand" is
		-- Its id, then its cards' shorthands:  stock: Q♠↑ 7♥↓
		set summary to its id + ":"
		for card in the pile
			set summary to summary + " " + the shorthand of the card
		return summary

	when a card is dropped
		move the card to the pile

	to move a card to a pile
		-- Move the card, and every card on top of it, onto the pile.
		-- The card's current pile can refuse to let go of it.
		-- The new pile may refuse to take it.
		-- If either of those is the case, the card doesn't move.
		-- A game can add its own steps after it:
			-- see `after moving a card to a pile` in Solitaire.spell
		cancel if the card's pile cannot give the card up
			or the pile cannot take the card
		for each card in cards in the card's pile starting with the card
			add it to the pile

a card
	-- A card can be in only one pile at a time:  moving it to another pile removes it.
	belongs to one pile
	-- OWEN: was `is on top of its pile`;  `is on bottom` is new, for auto play's king line
	a card "is on top" if it is the top card of its pile
	a card "is on bottom" if it is the first card of its pile

to test piles
	set the stock to a new pile with id "stock"
	stock's color should be "none"
	stock's value should be 0
	add a new card with rank queen, suit spades and direction up to the stock
	add a new card with rank 7, suit hearts and direction down to the stock
	stock's color should be red
	stock's value should be 7
	stock's shorthand should be "stock: Q♠↑ 7♥↓"

	-- a card is in one pile at a time
	set the discards to a new pile with id "discards"
	get the top card of the stock
	add it to the discards
	its pile is the discards should be yes
	the number of cards in the stock should be 1
	the discards' shorthand should be "discards: 7♥↓"
